  "elevationPhilosophy": "Elevation is whisper-quiet. Cards use a 1px subtle drop shadow at 25% black; most layering is communicated through surface color shifts (Carbon → Obsidian → Graphite) rather than shadow volume. The sole exception is modals, which use a dramatic offset shadow to feel like they physically exist in front of the void.",
